WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
The light-Bushin prerequisite leaves Ryu knocked down near the wall.

2
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.750
Crouching light punch intentionally whiffs.

3
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.350
Crouching medium kick hits Ryu during wake-up.

4
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.850
Crouching medium punch links from the low.

5
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.750
Standing medium punch continues into the heavy target.

6
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.700
Sprint slide and light Bushin extend the corner juggle.

7
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.100
The low branch ends in corner knockdown.
